# Searing Gorge - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 9 confirmed flagged rares of Searing
# Gorge and its fixed containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is
# not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE
# dropper is the rare. The four in-band rares without sole drops ship as
# kill-note rares (Fingat pattern); the one above-band rare ships with an
# honest come-back note (its three sole signatures argue for it) plus a
# bank-it-for-later note for the drop that starts an endgame chain the pack
# does not route yet (Loch Modan figurine precedent). No tame lines ship
# (the data has no tameability flag and the core guide carries no tame
# corroboration — see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are
# unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. No shipped rare is a giver,
# ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest; where a shipped rare
# also drops a core quest item the note says so and points at the core
# guide.
guide butler-routes-completionist/searing-gorge-rares
title Searing Gorge - Rares & Treasures
levels 40-52
zone Searing Gorge
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords searing gorge, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Highlord Mastrogonde — the west

  zone map 1427

  loop
  goto 14.54,37.20
  goto 29.32,27.99
  goto 29.47,26.42
  goto 30.48,25.91
  kill 8282 optional
  collect 282633 "Mastrogonde's Sinister Gown" optional
  note Level 51 rare working its 4 confirmed points in the west; its sole drop is Mastrogonde's Sinister Gown. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

