step The Behemoth — the far south-west

  zone map 1427

  goto 25.60,87.70
  kill 8924 optional
  collect 11603 "Vilerend Slicer" optional
  note Level 50 rare at its single confirmed point in the far south-west; its sole drop is the Vilerend Slicer. It also drops the Crumpled Up Note, which the core guide's Onyxia-note chain already routes alongside dozens of other droppers — this guide only points at the rare.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Scarshield Quartermaster — Blackrock (come back later)

  zone map 1427

  goto 43.30,99.20
  kill 9046 optional
  collect 13248 "Burstshot Harquebus" optional
  collect 13254 "Astral Guard" optional
  collect 18987 "Blackhand's Command" optional
  note Level 55 rare at its single confirmed point up at Blackrock; its three sole drops are the Burstshot Harquebus, the Astral Guard, and the Blackhand's Command. No quest takes it. Come back at high level - three over the guide band.
  note The Command starts an endgame chain the pack does not route yet - bank it for later. The companion never accepts or turns in.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

